WEBVTT

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.770
My brother!

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.530
Welcome home, big brother!

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.780
It'll be okay now, Ritsuka.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:02:01.050
"Tango of Passion and Seduction"

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.730
Uh, this is my big brother, Lindo.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:14.360
Lindo, this is our student
council president, Rem Kaginuki.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.080
Pleased to meet you.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:24.540
Let's get home.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:25.910
Huh? But...

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:31.170
Oh, uh, thank you for today!

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:34.960
Ow, Lindo, that hurts! Hey!

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.070
You sure got up on the wrong side of the bed.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:02.700
All the way to Nagano, and no sign
of the grimoire's whereabouts?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.290
I wish I could have seen that house burn down.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.790
How beautiful it must have been!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:16.750
I <i>told</i> you to steal it before someone else did.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.710
But no, you had to dawdle.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:26.390
But it's not often I see my
dear old friend and Arlond heir

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.430
go to this much trouble.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:38.730
I probably would have
done a better job of it. Say...

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.530
...if this piece were that girl...

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.740
No acting out of turn.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:47.950
Ooh, scary.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.670
So bright...

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:01.920
Who's there?!

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.680
Get up already.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.890
Lindo!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.730
Don't just barge into a
young lady's room like that!

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.600
Is that how a young lady sleeps?

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.650
You saw me?

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.070
Hurry up. Your breakfast is getting cold.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.490
You're infuriating!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.750
Mmm! Smells good!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.710
That's royal milk tea.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.340
You've always loved cooking.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:46.430
You've only gotten better at it
since you went to England.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.350
When you're done, go change out of your uniform.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.230
What for?

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:55.440
Take some time off.
Don't leave the house for a while.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.480
Huh?

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.650
And as I've said over and over since yesterday,

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.820
stay away from Rem Kaginuki.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.150
As I've asked over and over
since yesterday: why should I?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.570
No matter what.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:12.580
Ever since Mom disappeared,
all he's done is help me.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:15.580
Plus, I have to apologize
for the way you acted last night.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.250
Wh-What <i>is</i> this?

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.340
Holy water from Fatima.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:24.800
Holy water? What are you doing with that?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.800
Lindo?

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.430
You stay there.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.060
Sheesh! What's going on?

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.030
Big brother...

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.620
Don't you think he's being a little domineering?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.540
Was he always like that?

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.750
I can't say for sure...

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:03.250
but it's probably best
to do what he says for now.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.260
Aw!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.590
Hey, wanna get together and chat?
How about I come by after class?

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.640
My mom said I can
spend the night at your place--

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.390
And it's been a while since we've really talked.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:18.770
Yeah! I've got so much to tell you.
I bet it'll calm me down, too.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.650
Should I pick up some of those cream puffs?

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:25.030
What? The ones from Aspiration? I <i>love</i> those!

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.940
Okay, see you later!

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.900
Bye! I'll be waiting!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.740
Come in.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:37.000
Hey, Lindo, Azuna says she's spending the night.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.500
Good to hear.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.540
Did you need something?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.050
I'm heading out for a bit.

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.420
Where to?

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:49.090
Don't worry about Mom.
I'll figure something out.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:53.800
Just listen: don't leave this house.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.060
Figure something out, eh?

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.990
I'll keep Ritsuka safe.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:21.790
♪ Chatting with friends, ♪

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:29.760
♪ cream puffs, and herb tea are all things I like ♪

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:41.350
♪ Today's the same as yesterday.
I'm a normal high-school girl. ♪

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:51.200
Mom... please be all right.

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.630
Hey.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.590
Urie Sogami!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.510
So you remember me.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:15.760
Well, you're kind of famous.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.180
But what are you doing here?

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:22.390
You weren't at school.
Rem's worried about you.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:26.730
The student council president?
But I can't leave.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:30.530
My brother's worried about me
and told me to stay here.

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.780
No matter what?

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.780
Yes. And after you came all this way...

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:39.910
Oh, would you like a cup of tea?
You'll have to pardon the mess.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:44.000
No...

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:48.840
Actually, it seems there's
news about your mother.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.920
There is? Really?!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.550
The Kaginuki family has its
collective ear to the ground.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:56.930
I'll go get ready.

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.440
Is this where the president is?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.120
Come on in.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.460
Wow...

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:32.130
♪ So come, let's sing ♪

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:40.850
♪ Come, let's sing--it's a delightful party ♪

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:46.350
♪ This beautiful night will never end ♪

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.900
♪ And the party will go on forever ♪

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:53.820
♪ So come, let's sing ♪

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.830
Um...

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:05.750
Urie!

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.250
You're late!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.130
Er, I...

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:36.940
--Who's that?
--What's her deal?
--She's got some nerve!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:39.660
Yeah, I know, I know!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.160
Um, where's the president?

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.710
Welcome to my Eden.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:08.060
♪ Welcome to paradise, an Eden of amour ♪

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:11.060
♪ "Amour"--that means love ♪

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:14.270
♪ Isn't it heartpoundingly wonderful? ♪

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:20.400
♪ I'll hold you if you shiver ♪

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.530
♪ That's right, don't you fret ♪

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:29.620
♪ Be my darling butterfly and flap your wings ♪

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:38.340
♪ See: the moon and stars
bless us with their twinkling ♪

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:42.050
♪ A sweet night awaits us ♪

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:45.930
♪ Be free! ♪

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:50.020
♪ Dance, dance--take my hand ♪

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:53.650
♪ Taste the nectar of this forbidden play ♪

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:57.690
♪ Whirl, twirl--higher, faster ♪

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:01.570
♪ Until mind and body are one ♪

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.320
♪ Amour, amour--the more we amour ♪

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:09.580
♪ The more amour allures us! ♪

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:18.250
♪ I'll love you ♪

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.880
♪ With a dramatic kiss ♪

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.410
I--I just...

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:53.500
Er... So, um, where's the president?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.710
I really want to know more about my--

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:10.010
Two cream puffs--no, make that four.
How many can Ritsuka eat?

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:15.560
Huh? It's off. Oh, right: teachers' orders.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.600
"Voicemail Notification"
"1 New Message"

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.480
You have one voicemail.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:25.110
Azuna, sorry, but they found out
something about Mom.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.320
I'm heading out.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.080
Miss?

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:43.590
Was this place always this big?
Where's the way out?

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.060
What's going on?

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:01.820
Found her!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:02.820
Over there!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.460
There she is!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:26.470
We've got her now!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.980
Who touched this?

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:47.530
Gee, I wonder.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.570
Give us that pendant!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.070
No! My mom--

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:35.950
Stop! Let me go! Let me go, I said!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.330
This way.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:55.430
Looks like they're gone.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.140
Yes. Thank you so much.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:04.400
Don't move, or they'll find you.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:09.110
Who <i>are</i> they? And what is this place?

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:11.610
I'm sorry--that must have been frightening.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:16.870
My butterflies lose all control
when I'm involved.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:20.450
Where's the president?
I didn't tell anyone I was coming here--

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:24.250
if I don't get home soon, my brother will worry.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.500
Good question.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:29.460
What do you mean, "good question"?
You said he found out about Mom...

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.260
Were you lying?

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:37.050
Lying?<i> I'm</i> not the one lying.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:42.640
Say, why do you think your brother
up and went to England for school?

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:47.230
Huh? To study folklore.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:51.610
How do you know where my brother's studying?

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.860
I know a lot of things.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:57.740
Haven't your grandfather
or mother told you anything?

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:02.660
Like, say, about your brother's secret?

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:05.210
His secret? He doesn't have any secret.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:07.380
Listen carefully:

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:11.460
Your brother is an exorcist.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:18.510
He <i>is</i> studying abroad, but at
a special exorcist training school.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.930
But that's...

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.520
No way...

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:30.610
See? I'm not the liar here.

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.030
Neither is my brother!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.450
You sure do trust him, don't you.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:40.240
That's because you don't know
the first thing about the truth.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:45.960
Why would your brother not tell you
he was becoming an exorcist?

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:48.830
And then your mother...

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:53.460
My mother? Are you saying there's
something I don't know about her?

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:58.260
Ask the brother you trust so well.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:01.760
Though I can't promise he'll tell you.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.270
It can't be...

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:09.690
Sweet little know-nothing Ritsuka.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.860
Come here. I'll make you feel better.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:33.670
Oho... you smell sweeter than a rose.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.960
So beautiful...

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:42.140
Where is the grimoire? You're the only key left.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:44.970
Grim... oire...

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:52.860
I can't hold you with that in the way.
Take off the pendant.

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.030
Rem!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.540
Rem!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.670
I told you not to act out of turn.

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.090
Let's go.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:20.550
We still have important matters to discuss.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.260
You want to know, don't you?

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.600
Come on.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.890
Well?

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:33.020
Ritsuka!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.190
You call her by name?

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:44.830
Tell me: If everyone around you
is little more than a chess piece,

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:49.410
why does <i>she</i> have you all hot under the collar?

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:52.620
You can't even tell your old childhood friend?

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.630
It has nothing to do with you.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:59.760
Or do you doubt my loyalty?

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:04.140
Is that why you're afraid
I'll get the grimoire first?

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:08.680
I mean, strengthwise, we're not so different.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:12.480
In fact, sometimes I've
gotten the better of you.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:15.690
That must be it, then.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.360
Enough.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:30.830
Ritsuka!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.920
Lindo! These weird people were just--

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:38.000
That's no amusement park...

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:43.930
Were you dreaming? So much has happened--
You must be exhausted.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.090
But--

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:48.890
I'm glad I came to get you. Let's head home.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.180
Uh-huh.

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:57.900
How did you know where I was?

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.030
Big brother... how?

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:09.280
Your brother is an exorcist.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.680
You are all my butterflies.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:32.220
But you, Ritsuka... you're special.

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:38.270
That sweet fragrance...
I wanted to see how you'd dance!

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:45.030
My special butterfly... mine and mine alone.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:54.830
I'll hold you until you fall apart.

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:30.300
I'll do whatever it takes
to protect you, Ritsuka.

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:33.220
Ritsuka... I want to keep you safe.

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:37.140
I <i>will</i> protect Ritsuka. You'll see.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:41.100
"Bolero of Solitude and Melancholy"

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:40.770
Act 4: Bolero of Solitude and Melancholy.
